{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-19T15:37:27.170Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"49b778ef43b03792a11c1946","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-19T15:37:27.170Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Real-label held-out evaluation: 24 pairs (8 positives,16 lexical controls), dev 81 (27/54); 35 real positive closures overall, 8 retrieval misses overall and 1 held out. Lexical: precision 30.4%, recall 87.5%, F1 45.2%, abstain 0%, 62.0 ms/pair. tev1:0.8b: precision 46.2%, recall 75.0%, F1 57.1%, abstain 41.7%, 892.5 ms/pair. tev1:4b: precision/recall/F1 62.5%, abstain 16.7%, 5571.7 ms/pair. Wilson intervals and F1 envelope are in README and calibration/dedupe-report-v1.json. Total elapsed 810.5 s; 107 sequential calls/model including an excluded identical-text control and a counted replacement repetition after postprocessing failure. Cutoffs use dev-F1, 0.8 model floor, three positive predictions and one true positive. Controls remain closed-world labels; small correlated samples and weak precision preclude a readiness claim."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-19T15:37:27.170Z"}],"before_hash":"389027940efdc379494cf25a806fce8493af5a968034cd1b95753cdc5d31d024","after_hash":"dca31a0e107d73fce7d3e969ff145397a85eaf9f8f4dab2d136e65cce3599649","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_versio